1
00:00:02,297 --> 00:00:04,037
(Episode 6)

2
00:00:04,097 --> 00:00:05,367
(Sibling 2)

3
00:00:21,017 --> 00:00:22,317
Excuse me...

4
00:00:22,387 --> 00:00:23,857
Are you okay?

5
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:29,527
May I have your attention, please.

6
00:00:29,587 --> 00:00:30,997
Currently, on the upper floors of the guest rooms,

7
00:00:31,057 --> 00:00:33,127
a fire sensor has been activated.

8
00:00:33,197 --> 00:00:35,497
We ask all guests to use the emergency exits...

9
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:38,437
and evacuate immediately.

10
00:00:38,497 --> 00:00:40,807
Hey. Oh, no.

11
00:00:40,867 --> 00:00:43,477
Please wake up. Are you okay?

12
00:00:45,437 --> 00:00:48,177
Water, if you have any...

13
00:00:48,247 --> 00:00:50,377
- Water? - Please give me some water.

14
00:00:50,447 --> 00:00:51,777
I have water. Just a moment.

15
00:01:02,157 --> 00:01:04,357
Slowly, try to swallow slowly.

16
00:01:09,727 --> 00:01:11,167
What do I do?

17
00:01:11,237 --> 00:01:12,837
Mom, what do I do with him?

18
00:01:20,547 --> 00:01:22,847
Excuse me. It is okay.

19
00:01:22,907 --> 00:01:24,677
You will be okay.

20
00:01:24,747 --> 00:01:26,447
Follow my lead...

21
00:01:26,517 --> 00:01:28,587
and let us take slow, deep breaths.

22
00:01:30,257 --> 00:01:31,257
One.

23
00:01:33,187 --> 00:01:34,187
Two.

24
00:01:36,127 --> 00:01:38,127
You cannot lose consciousness.

25
00:01:38,197 --> 00:01:39,197
One.

26
00:01:40,797 --> 00:01:41,797
Two.

27
00:01:56,977 --> 00:01:59,477
This is an announcement for all guests.

28
00:01:59,547 --> 00:02:02,117
The door on the third floor where the fire sensor was activated...

29
00:02:02,187 --> 00:02:03,957
has been confirmed to be clear of any issues,

30
00:02:04,017 --> 00:02:06,787
- Oh, thank goodness. - so please rest assured...

31
00:02:06,857 --> 00:02:08,727
and use the hotel facilities,

32
00:02:08,787 --> 00:02:10,697
- including your rooms... - I guess it was nothing serious.

33
00:02:10,757 --> 00:02:12,927
It is okay. You can relax now.

34
00:02:17,937 --> 00:02:18,997
Oh, my.

35
00:02:19,067 --> 00:02:22,637
- Lean on me. - No, I can walk by myself.

36
00:02:22,707 --> 00:02:24,637
Oh, all right, then.

37
00:02:26,877 --> 00:02:28,347
Goodness.

38
00:02:28,407 --> 00:02:30,107
Oh, why are you embarrassed at a time like this?

39
00:02:30,177 --> 00:02:32,647
It is not like we will ever see each other again anyway.

40
00:02:32,717 --> 00:02:33,717
There.

41
00:02:36,817 --> 00:02:38,057
What room are you staying in?

42
00:02:39,057 --> 00:02:41,057
The suite at the far left end.

43
00:02:41,127 --> 00:02:43,127
- Just a moment. - Yes, yes.

44
00:02:43,187 --> 00:02:44,657
Wow, a suite.

45
00:02:46,697 --> 00:02:47,867
Well.

46
00:02:47,927 --> 00:02:50,127
I mean, staying in a luxury hotel like this,

47
00:02:50,197 --> 00:02:52,737
and in a suite, no less,

48
00:02:52,797 --> 00:02:53,907
made me jealous for a second.

49
00:02:55,637 --> 00:02:58,877
It is just a building. It is just a room.

50
00:02:58,937 --> 00:03:01,977
Yes, but it is not just any room, is it?

51
00:03:02,047 --> 00:03:04,247
It is an incredibly expensive room, right?

52
00:03:04,317 --> 00:03:05,947
Yes, I suppose it could be...

53
00:03:06,017 --> 00:03:08,187
for people who cannot afford it.

54
00:03:10,587 --> 00:03:11,587
Gosh.

55
00:03:14,557 --> 00:03:16,557
I saved him when he almost died,

56
00:03:16,627 --> 00:03:19,357
but he really is not from the same world as me.

57
00:03:19,427 --> 00:03:20,697
I should just keep quiet.

58
00:03:20,767 --> 00:03:22,197
The world he lives in and the way his brain works...

59
00:03:22,267 --> 00:03:23,397
make him a completely different species.

60
00:03:23,467 --> 00:03:25,037
Have you only been working for a day or two, Kang Da Mi?

61
00:03:26,667 --> 00:03:28,537
You have someone with you, right?

62
00:03:28,607 --> 00:03:30,067
I think you might need someone...

63
00:03:30,137 --> 00:03:32,407
- to look after you. - No, this...

64
00:03:33,577 --> 00:03:35,407
I am fine for now.

65
00:03:35,477 --> 00:03:36,577
If you do not mind,

66
00:03:36,647 --> 00:03:39,217
could you please guide me just to the door?

67
00:03:39,277 --> 00:03:40,547
Oh, yes, I can do that.

68
00:03:41,747 --> 00:03:42,747
Oh my.

69
00:03:44,587 --> 00:03:46,657
Is this the right place?

70
00:03:46,717 --> 00:03:48,957
- Yes, thank you. - Oh, yes.

71
00:03:52,527 --> 00:03:54,797
Oh, please stay still. I will do it.

72
00:03:59,467 --> 00:04:00,467
What?

73
00:04:02,307 --> 00:04:03,807
Why is it not working?

74
00:04:16,887 --> 00:04:18,057
Oh, right.

75
00:04:23,627 --> 00:04:25,097
I am sorry for taking up your time.

76
00:04:25,157 --> 00:04:29,327
Oh, no, it is not a big deal at all. We have to help each other out.

77
00:04:29,397 --> 00:04:30,437
Please go inside.

78
00:04:38,877 --> 00:04:40,447
Will he be okay?

79
00:04:42,647 --> 00:04:44,047
He has to be okay.

80
00:04:49,747 --> 00:04:50,857
(Sibling 2)

81
00:04:52,487 --> 00:04:54,657
I do not have the slightest intention of helping you,

82
00:04:54,727 --> 00:04:55,957
so why do you keep calling me?

83
00:04:57,197 --> 00:04:58,697
Dae Chi, you are capable.

84
00:04:58,757 --> 00:05:00,057
You've worked at a big firm for years,

85
00:05:00,127 --> 00:05:01,997
so why are you trying to squeeze blood from a stone?

86
00:05:03,637 --> 00:05:05,736
Go to the bank. If you go to the bank,

87
00:05:05,737 --> 00:05:07,867
they will easily open an overdraft account...

88
00:05:07,937 --> 00:05:09,237
for a capable person like you.

89
00:05:10,477 --> 00:05:12,137
Well...

90
00:05:12,207 --> 00:05:14,207
I do not care. Do not call me again.

91
00:05:14,277 --> 00:05:16,507
Hey, little sister. Da Mi. Kang Da Mi.

92
00:05:20,387 --> 00:05:21,717
Unbelievable.

93
00:05:21,787 --> 00:05:23,917
If he had ever bought me a single pair of socks for my birthday,

94
00:05:23,987 --> 00:05:25,387
I would not be acting like this.

95
00:05:26,487 --> 00:05:27,987
Gosh, what a pain.

96
00:05:29,387 --> 00:05:31,727
But how did he end up in so much debt?

97
00:05:35,497 --> 00:05:38,437
Wow. After everything I did to raise her.

98
00:05:40,067 --> 00:05:42,807
I wiped her runny nose when she was little, you know?

99
00:05:42,867 --> 00:05:44,037
I played dolls with her,

100
00:05:44,107 --> 00:05:46,577
and I always gave her rides on the back of my bike.

101
00:05:46,637 --> 00:05:48,077
How can my one and only sister...

102
00:05:48,147 --> 00:05:49,977
not even wonder how I ended up in debt?

103
00:05:53,717 --> 00:05:55,117
Now Mom is my only hope.

104
00:05:57,057 --> 00:05:59,557
How am I supposed to bring this up to Ms. Jo Mi Mi?

105
00:06:01,257 --> 00:06:02,257
Gosh.

106
00:06:10,397 --> 00:06:11,897
Oh, I am sorry. Are you...

107
00:06:13,707 --> 00:06:15,637
- What? - Hello.

108
00:06:17,207 --> 00:06:18,737
Excuse me.

109
00:06:18,807 --> 00:06:20,707
You are Manager Kang, right?

110
00:06:20,777 --> 00:06:22,747
Oh, yes.

111
00:06:22,807 --> 00:06:25,417
You look like you are in pain, so I am really sorry.

112
00:06:25,477 --> 00:06:27,717
I am fine. Excuse me.

113
00:06:31,857 --> 00:06:33,657
Does she really think I am some kind of weirdo?

114
00:06:34,957 --> 00:06:36,327
This feels pretty uncomfortable.

115
00:06:38,497 --> 00:06:41,367
Cha Se Na. Se Na.

116
00:06:55,907 --> 00:06:56,907
I am sorry for being late.

117
00:06:56,977 --> 00:06:58,277
I had an urgent matter to take care of.

118
00:06:59,947 --> 00:07:01,817
But what is Assistant Manager Kang doing here?

119
00:07:03,417 --> 00:07:05,657
The ceiling is not going to collapse, Son.

120
00:07:05,717 --> 00:07:06,987
Have a seat.

121
00:07:07,057 --> 00:07:08,057
Oh, okay.

122
00:07:14,727 --> 00:07:17,237
Your mom specially invited...

123
00:07:17,297 --> 00:07:19,667
Assistant Manager Kang to our meal today.

124
00:07:19,737 --> 00:07:21,537
She is more passionate than anyone else at the company,

125
00:07:21,607 --> 00:07:22,837
and her performance is outstanding,

126
00:07:22,907 --> 00:07:24,507
so she really wanted to treat her to a meal.

127
00:07:25,737 --> 00:07:27,077
Thank you, Assistant Manager Kang.

128
00:07:27,147 --> 00:07:28,547
I look forward to your continued good work.

129
00:07:29,577 --> 00:07:31,217
I hope this dinner is not too uncomfortable for you.

130
00:07:31,277 --> 00:07:32,777
Oh, I am fine.

131
00:07:32,847 --> 00:07:34,787
I am just grateful for the invitation,

132
00:07:34,847 --> 00:07:36,047
and it is an honour, sir.

133
00:07:37,457 --> 00:07:39,917
- Yes, CEO Jeon. - Is the sirloin good today?

134
00:07:39,987 --> 00:07:41,587
Yes, of course.

135
00:07:41,657 --> 00:07:43,687
Okay, we will go with the special course.

136
00:07:43,757 --> 00:07:46,697
- And the usual wine. - Thank you.

137
00:07:48,327 --> 00:07:51,137
Oh, but why did you not invite Se Na too?

138
00:07:51,197 --> 00:07:54,037
It would have been nice if you brought Grandma as well.

139
00:07:54,107 --> 00:07:57,537
Today, I specifically wanted to see my son...

140
00:07:57,607 --> 00:08:00,977
and Assistant Manager Kang sitting side by side.

141
00:08:01,047 --> 00:08:02,277
Along with your father.

142
00:08:04,047 --> 00:08:05,947
Why?

143
00:08:06,017 --> 00:08:09,047
Hey, are you really that clueless,

144
00:08:09,117 --> 00:08:11,217
or are you just pretending to be?

145
00:08:11,287 --> 00:08:15,227
Oh, I am just asking because it is a bit uncomfortable.

146
00:08:15,287 --> 00:08:17,827
From Assistant Manager Kang's perspective,

147
00:08:17,897 --> 00:08:19,627
having dinner with her bosses after work...

148
00:08:19,697 --> 00:08:21,697
could be difficult and burdensome.

149
00:08:21,767 --> 00:08:24,037
I like it, Team Leader Cha.

150
00:08:24,097 --> 00:08:27,667
I think it will be an unforgettable and happy memory.

151
00:08:29,137 --> 00:08:30,467
I do not know about happy.

152
00:08:32,337 --> 00:08:33,977
What do you think, honey?

153
00:08:34,047 --> 00:08:35,307
Do they not look great together?

154
00:08:36,347 --> 00:08:37,377
We must have had...

155
00:08:37,447 --> 00:08:41,287
a beautiful youth like that at some point too.

156
00:08:41,347 --> 00:08:43,687
I do not know where the time went.

157
00:08:45,987 --> 00:08:47,727
They are a beautiful couple.

158
00:08:49,387 --> 00:08:53,597
Oh, of course, you are still as radiant as ever.

159
00:08:59,567 --> 00:09:02,767
My father is a bit of an extreme romantic.

160
00:09:02,837 --> 00:09:04,037
Just let it go, Assistant Manager Kang.

161
00:09:11,117 --> 00:09:13,547
- I am home. - You are late.

162
00:09:15,447 --> 00:09:17,357
Yes, I had to go somewhere.

163
00:09:19,487 --> 00:09:21,727
Hey, have you contacted your mom today?

164
00:09:23,087 --> 00:09:24,827
Why?

165
00:09:24,897 --> 00:09:28,697
She went out to look for Mi Seon, and I cannot reach her at all.

166
00:09:28,767 --> 00:09:29,927
She has completely disappeared.

167
00:09:35,807 --> 00:09:38,607
The phone is turned off. After the beep...

168
00:09:40,677 --> 00:09:44,677
Her phone is turned off. Her battery must have died.

169
00:09:44,747 --> 00:09:47,346
You are just jumping to conclusions.

170
00:09:47,347 --> 00:09:52,117
Hey, your In-law is worried sick right now.

171
00:09:52,187 --> 00:09:55,757
Her eldest grandson got divorced and is moping around like that.

172
00:09:55,827 --> 00:09:59,797
Your grandma might be keeping her mouth shut for now,

173
00:09:59,857 --> 00:10:01,297
but she must be torn up inside.

174
00:10:02,297 --> 00:10:07,197
What about your Mom? You and Dae Chi, get a grip...

175
00:10:07,267 --> 00:10:09,037
and live right, okay?

176
00:10:09,107 --> 00:10:10,877
If you two cause trouble on top of this,

177
00:10:10,937 --> 00:10:15,407
your mom and the elders will all collapse one by one.

178
00:10:15,477 --> 00:10:17,177
They definitely will.

179
00:10:18,577 --> 00:10:20,217
Go inside.

180
00:10:20,277 --> 00:10:21,517
You go in first.

181
00:10:21,587 --> 00:10:23,787
I have to finish 1,000 of these before I go in.

182
00:10:23,847 --> 00:10:28,157
- How many have you done? - About 55? Maybe 56?

183
00:10:29,627 --> 00:10:31,997
You will be up all night.

184
00:10:32,057 --> 00:10:33,057
Good luck.

185
00:10:35,397 --> 00:10:37,067
Again.

186
00:10:37,127 --> 00:10:38,497
Wait a minute.

187
00:10:38,567 --> 00:10:41,007
She definitely cheered me on before she left.

188
00:10:41,067 --> 00:10:42,337
Why do I feel so offended?

189
00:10:43,937 --> 00:10:45,977
Seriously, Da Mi and I...

190
00:10:46,037 --> 00:10:48,247
are just not on the same wavelength.

191
00:10:48,307 --> 00:10:49,307
Gosh.

192
00:10:50,677 --> 00:10:51,947
One, two, three.

193
00:10:54,347 --> 00:10:56,187
Hey, you just got here?

194
00:10:57,917 --> 00:11:00,687
Gang Nam, can you eat raw ramyeon at a time like this?

195
00:11:02,027 --> 00:11:04,757
I lost my appetite because I feel too guilty.

196
00:11:04,827 --> 00:11:09,027
I am just filling my empty stomach and soul with this raw ramyeon,

197
00:11:09,097 --> 00:11:10,897
so why are you picking a fight?

198
00:11:10,967 --> 00:11:12,897
Hey, Da Mi, my little sister.

199
00:11:12,967 --> 00:11:17,637
Your big brother is already in a terribly miserable situation,

200
00:11:17,707 --> 00:11:19,277
so do not give me a hard time too.

201
00:11:20,437 --> 00:11:22,607
Look here, Mr. Kang Gang Nam.

202
00:11:22,677 --> 00:11:24,577
No, I mean, dear brother.

203
00:11:24,647 --> 00:11:27,517
Mom went out to look for Mi Seon in broad daylight,

204
00:11:27,587 --> 00:11:29,687
and we have not been able to reach her all day.

205
00:11:30,857 --> 00:11:35,687
You are really not showing any humility right now.

206
00:11:35,757 --> 00:11:37,327
Hey.

207
00:11:37,397 --> 00:11:39,497
Then what, should I sit on my knees...

208
00:11:39,557 --> 00:11:41,527
with both hands raised in the air at my age?

209
00:11:41,597 --> 00:11:46,637
Your brother, Kang Gang Nam, already ran several laps...

210
00:11:46,697 --> 00:11:47,967
around the neighbourhood earlier,

211
00:11:48,037 --> 00:11:50,007
so I am incredibly exhausted right now.

212
00:11:50,067 --> 00:11:51,777
You understand?

213
00:11:51,837 --> 00:11:53,307
I am also carrying...

214
00:11:53,377 --> 00:11:56,507
a five-ton truckload of worry inside, you punk.

215
00:11:58,847 --> 00:11:59,847
Where is Su Ah?

216
00:12:01,287 --> 00:12:02,317
In Grandma's room.

217
00:12:04,857 --> 00:12:07,657
Grandma, I am home.

218
00:12:07,727 --> 00:12:08,957
Welcome back.

219
00:12:13,157 --> 00:12:16,597
Are you not going to lay her down? Your arms must hurt.

220
00:12:17,697 --> 00:12:21,467
If she at least cried for her mom,

221
00:12:21,537 --> 00:12:23,667
I would feel a little less sorry for her.

222
00:12:23,737 --> 00:12:26,307
She has been keeping her mouth shut and sulking all day,

223
00:12:26,377 --> 00:12:28,977
only pretending to eat her dinner.

224
00:12:29,047 --> 00:12:32,877
What sin did this child commit? I cannot put her down.

225
00:12:36,287 --> 00:12:40,417
Your mom went out to find Mi Seon, and she still has not come back yet.

226
00:12:41,687 --> 00:12:43,857
She must be trying to conjure Mi Seon out of thin air.

227
00:12:45,997 --> 00:12:47,297
I know, right?

228
00:12:47,357 --> 00:12:49,097
Since you asked her to do it, Grandma,

229
00:12:49,167 --> 00:12:50,327
she is probably trying to conjure her up...

230
00:12:50,397 --> 00:12:51,397
and bring her back no matter what.

231
00:12:54,107 --> 00:12:57,067
It would be nice if she actually had that kind of talent.

232
00:12:57,137 --> 00:13:01,007
She is probably burning up inside and squatting in some corner today.

233
00:13:05,147 --> 00:13:08,447
By the way, Da Mi. About you.

234
00:13:08,517 --> 00:13:11,757
- Yes? - Are you still not seeing anyone?

235
00:13:12,787 --> 00:13:14,227
Well, Grandma.

236
00:13:16,057 --> 00:13:18,027
There are absolutely no decent men...

237
00:13:18,097 --> 00:13:20,227
around me, no matter how hard I look.

238
00:13:21,367 --> 00:13:23,597
So you are telling me you have never even...

239
00:13:23,667 --> 00:13:25,567
held a man's hand before?

240
00:13:26,667 --> 00:13:28,837
We have a problem.

241
00:13:28,907 --> 00:13:32,407
How can you be so clueless?

242
00:13:32,477 --> 00:13:33,477
Hold hands?

243
00:13:42,387 --> 00:13:45,157
Excuse me. It is okay.

244
00:13:45,217 --> 00:13:46,357
You will be okay.

245
00:13:47,857 --> 00:13:49,987
I have held a hand, Grandma.

246
00:13:51,227 --> 00:13:54,197
Are you kidding me?

247
00:13:54,267 --> 00:13:55,897
As if.

248
00:13:55,967 --> 00:13:57,997
I am serious.

249
00:13:58,067 --> 00:13:59,967
When?

250
00:14:00,037 --> 00:14:02,407
That is a secret. Anyway, I have held one.

251
00:14:04,377 --> 00:14:06,607
Well, that is a miracle.

252
00:14:06,677 --> 00:14:09,177
Keep working hard on that front, too.

253
00:14:09,247 --> 00:14:13,277
Both Ms. Jo and I need to see you get married...

254
00:14:13,347 --> 00:14:15,647
and live happily with your own children...

255
00:14:15,717 --> 00:14:17,557
so we can pass away in peace.

256
00:14:19,357 --> 00:14:21,257
I am not confident right now, but...

257
00:14:22,427 --> 00:14:25,097
Yes, I will try my best.

258
00:14:25,157 --> 00:14:27,227
Mom will be home soon.

259
00:14:27,297 --> 00:14:29,927
Why borrow trouble and worry in advance?

260
00:14:29,997 --> 00:14:32,237
Go to sleep first, Grandma.

261
00:14:32,297 --> 00:14:33,297
Okay.

262
00:14:53,457 --> 00:14:54,987
This is driving me crazy.

263
00:14:56,087 --> 00:14:57,957
If Mom finds out Dae Chi caused trouble too,

264
00:14:58,027 --> 00:14:59,527
Mom will go crazy.

265
00:15:01,667 --> 00:15:02,797
That jerk Kang Dae Chi...

266
00:15:02,867 --> 00:15:05,097
he would not ask Mom for money, would he?

267
00:15:09,937 --> 00:15:11,477
Wow, a suite.

268
00:15:13,737 --> 00:15:15,546
I mean, staying in a luxury hotel like this,

269
00:15:15,547 --> 00:15:18,547
and in a suite, no less,

270
00:15:18,617 --> 00:15:19,747
made me jealous for a second.

271
00:15:21,417 --> 00:15:24,087
It is just a building. It is just a room.

272
00:15:26,957 --> 00:15:29,657
"It is just a building and just a room."

273
00:15:31,757 --> 00:15:33,927
He looks perfectly fine on the outside.

274
00:15:35,297 --> 00:15:36,867
But he is so cold.

275
00:15:37,997 --> 00:15:39,667
Would it kill him to be a little warm?

276
00:15:39,737 --> 00:15:40,737
Does it cost money?

277
00:15:46,337 --> 00:15:48,277
He will be okay, right?

278
00:15:49,577 --> 00:15:52,747
Who am I worrying about right now?

279
00:15:52,817 --> 00:15:55,417
Stop being so nosy, Da Mi.

280
00:15:55,487 --> 00:15:57,247
You saved his life, what more do you want?

281
00:15:58,557 --> 00:16:00,887
My own house is a mess right now.

282
00:16:26,847 --> 00:16:29,017
Slowly, try to swallow slowly.

283
00:16:36,427 --> 00:16:40,597
Excuse me. It is okay. You will be okay.

284
00:16:40,657 --> 00:16:42,427
Follow my lead...

285
00:16:42,497 --> 00:16:44,437
and let us take slow, deep breaths.

286
00:16:49,307 --> 00:16:50,607
Why did it have to be at that exact moment?

287
00:16:55,677 --> 00:16:58,177
I told you to talk with me before going upstairs, son.

288
00:16:59,447 --> 00:17:01,047
Assistant Manager Kang,

289
00:17:01,117 --> 00:17:03,847
how was it seeing her outside of work today?

290
00:17:03,917 --> 00:17:05,617
How do you think? It was awkward.

291
00:17:06,657 --> 00:17:09,787
Why would you invite my subordinate to a family dinner, Mom?

292
00:17:09,857 --> 00:17:12,827
Especially on your wedding anniversary.

293
00:17:12,897 --> 00:17:14,697
I was so uncomfortable.

294
00:17:14,767 --> 00:17:17,767
Have you not thought at all about why I invited her?

295
00:17:20,867 --> 00:17:22,567
Is Assistant Manager Kang...

296
00:17:22,637 --> 00:17:24,337
your candidate for a daughter-in-law?

297
00:17:24,407 --> 00:17:27,037
See, you already figured it out.

298
00:17:27,107 --> 00:17:29,447
What a shame. I have absolutely no feelings for her.

299
00:17:29,507 --> 00:17:31,517
Then you can start showing interest from now on.

300
00:17:31,577 --> 00:17:33,447
Is that so hard?

301
00:17:33,517 --> 00:17:37,317
To me, you two look great together.

302
00:17:37,387 --> 00:17:39,617
You saw how pleased your father was, too.

303
00:17:39,687 --> 00:17:41,587
We work together on the same team.

304
00:17:41,657 --> 00:17:43,887
We see each other for most of the day.

305
00:17:43,957 --> 00:17:45,297
It is a no for me.

306
00:17:45,357 --> 00:17:47,327
That is because you only see her as a subordinate.

307
00:17:47,397 --> 00:17:49,327
Try looking at her as a woman.

308
00:17:50,397 --> 00:17:53,837
At least try, Do Yun. It is a favour for me, okay?

309
00:17:55,537 --> 00:17:57,337
You will do it, right?

310
00:17:57,407 --> 00:17:59,637
Why do you like Assistant Manager Kang so much, Mom?

311
00:18:01,647 --> 00:18:03,407
Ever since I joined this family...

312
00:18:03,477 --> 00:18:06,577
and started raising you, Do Yun,

313
00:18:06,647 --> 00:18:11,587
I wondered who would suit you best.

314
00:18:11,657 --> 00:18:14,257
I really thought about it every day.

315
00:18:14,317 --> 00:18:17,427
And she is the first one who caught my eye.

316
00:18:17,487 --> 00:18:20,327
Do not just brush off what I say...

317
00:18:20,397 --> 00:18:21,767
and give it some serious thought.

318
00:18:24,497 --> 00:18:25,667
I understand, Mom.

319
00:18:25,737 --> 00:18:28,437
But do not expect too much right away.

320
00:18:29,537 --> 00:18:33,177
As expected, I live for my son.

321
00:18:41,117 --> 00:18:42,617
Son.

322
00:18:42,687 --> 00:18:45,557
Why do I like her so much as a daughter-in-law?

323
00:18:46,657 --> 00:18:50,027
I need a marble by your side...

324
00:18:50,087 --> 00:18:53,197
that I can roll around however I want.

325
00:18:59,667 --> 00:19:00,967
Mom.

326
00:19:01,467 --> 00:19:02,707
I am really upset.

327
00:19:03,737 --> 00:19:04,737
Why?

328
00:19:04,807 --> 00:19:07,137
Why? You left Grandma and me out...

329
00:19:07,207 --> 00:19:09,407
and only took Do Yun out to eat?

330
00:19:09,477 --> 00:19:12,717
Am I not a child of this house? Grandma is clear-headed today, too,

331
00:19:12,777 --> 00:19:14,647
so we all could have gone out together.

332
00:19:14,717 --> 00:19:17,047
I am sorry, there was a reason.

333
00:19:17,117 --> 00:19:18,357
What reason?

334
00:19:18,417 --> 00:19:20,017
You do not need to know that.

335
00:19:21,117 --> 00:19:22,627
I will bring it to her.

336
00:19:22,687 --> 00:19:23,687
Okay.

337
00:19:24,427 --> 00:19:26,157
So, Mother.

338
00:19:26,227 --> 00:19:29,627
It seems my wife really liked that young lady.

339
00:19:29,697 --> 00:19:31,537
I saw her at the dinner too,

340
00:19:31,597 --> 00:19:36,907
- and she is smart and confident. - How tacky.

341
00:19:36,967 --> 00:19:40,177
- Pardon? - What era are we living in...

342
00:19:40,237 --> 00:19:43,707
that parents are stepping in to choose their children's partners?

343
00:19:43,777 --> 00:19:45,717
Do you have nothing better to do?

344
00:19:45,777 --> 00:19:47,917
You should let them find their own partners.

345
00:19:47,987 --> 00:19:49,117
Oh, my.

346
00:19:49,187 --> 00:19:51,187
My, how insecure do you have to be to do that?

347
00:19:51,257 --> 00:19:53,887
Can you not trust your grown children that much?

348
00:19:56,427 --> 00:19:58,027
Right.

349
00:19:58,097 --> 00:20:01,927
But in her own way, she is just doing her best for Do Yun.

350
00:20:01,997 --> 00:20:03,397
And ever since she first started raising Do Yun,

351
00:20:03,467 --> 00:20:06,567
she has always been like that. She wanted to find him a good match...

352
00:20:06,637 --> 00:20:08,407
and see him live well.

353
00:20:09,967 --> 00:20:11,337
She is just stepping in...

354
00:20:11,407 --> 00:20:13,437
because she wants to do things her own way.

355
00:20:13,507 --> 00:20:16,247
Exactly, you cannot fool my eyes.

356
00:20:16,307 --> 00:20:18,377
- Gosh. - Come on.

357
00:20:18,447 --> 00:20:21,417
Mother, you are really misunderstanding.

358
00:20:21,487 --> 00:20:23,587
If she hears that, she will be really hurt.

359
00:20:28,857 --> 00:20:29,857
Honey.

360
00:20:31,397 --> 00:20:33,427
What would I be hurt about?

361
00:20:33,497 --> 00:20:35,697
Oh, it is nothing, honey.

362
00:20:37,427 --> 00:20:38,637
Please try some, Mother.

363
00:20:44,407 --> 00:20:48,107
- What is wrong, Mother? - Did you get Seung Yun's room...

364
00:20:48,177 --> 00:20:49,207
all set up nicely?

365
00:20:50,547 --> 00:20:55,317
Why are you worrying about that? I have already prepared everything.

366
00:20:55,387 --> 00:20:57,217
And you,

367
00:20:57,287 --> 00:21:00,487
if you are going to step up and find partners for the kids,

368
00:21:01,687 --> 00:21:03,727
should Seung Yun not be first?

369
00:21:03,787 --> 00:21:07,527
Seung Yun is the eldest grandson of this family.

370
00:21:07,597 --> 00:21:08,627
Did you forget?

371
00:21:11,537 --> 00:21:12,737
I am sorry, Mother.

372
00:21:12,797 --> 00:21:14,167
I was actually going to talk to Seung Yun...

373
00:21:14,237 --> 00:21:18,137
once he returns and settles in about that very thing.

374
00:21:18,207 --> 00:21:21,677
Seung Yun should definitely come first.

375
00:21:21,747 --> 00:21:24,977
I will take care of it, so please do not worry.

376
00:21:25,047 --> 00:21:26,877
Just because he is one step removed,

377
00:21:26,947 --> 00:21:30,447
do not even think about neglecting him as just a nephew.

378
00:21:30,517 --> 00:21:33,056
My mind might come and go,

379
00:21:33,057 --> 00:21:34,556
but I have absolutely no intention...

380
00:21:34,557 --> 00:21:36,587
of looking at the inside of a coffin anytime soon.

381
00:21:37,727 --> 00:21:42,127
Grandma, do not be so angry. Try a piece of hangwa. Okay?

382
00:22:03,287 --> 00:22:04,287
Yes, Mother.

383
00:22:05,317 --> 00:22:07,057
Please live a long, long time.

384
00:22:08,487 --> 00:22:10,657
So I can win an award for being a dutiful daughter-in-law.

385
00:22:21,767 --> 00:22:24,037
- Dad. - Yes.

386
00:22:24,107 --> 00:22:26,437
I feel bad for Mom, Dad.

387
00:22:26,507 --> 00:22:28,807
Grandma is always picking on Mom.

388
00:22:28,877 --> 00:22:30,847
I think she is getting worse as she gets older.

389
00:22:31,977 --> 00:22:35,087
She only gets like that when it comes to Seung Yun.

390
00:22:35,147 --> 00:22:37,087
She feels bad for Seung Yun...

391
00:22:37,147 --> 00:22:39,417
and has a strong desire to protect him.

392
00:22:39,487 --> 00:22:41,487
My uncle and aunt died so young,

393
00:22:41,557 --> 00:22:45,427
and it breaks my heart too. I know. I really do.

394
00:22:45,497 --> 00:22:48,327
That is why our whole family treats Seung Yun so well.

395
00:22:48,397 --> 00:22:50,697
Seung Yun went to the US and succeeded, too.

396
00:22:50,767 --> 00:22:53,737
Honestly, do Mom and Dad not deserve the most credit for that?

397
00:22:53,797 --> 00:22:55,137
Mom must be so upset.

398
00:22:55,207 --> 00:22:57,807
Oh, my daughter is so sweet.

399
00:22:57,867 --> 00:23:00,807
- You have grown up a lot. - Oh, I was always sweet.

400
00:23:02,907 --> 00:23:04,507
Grandma's mind was clear today, so...

401
00:23:04,577 --> 00:23:06,747
I was actually going to ask her to invest in me.

402
00:23:08,087 --> 00:23:10,687
She would have said you are too young for a business.

403
00:23:10,747 --> 00:23:14,587
Mom, Dad, and Do Yun all ignore what I say,

404
00:23:14,657 --> 00:23:16,887
so I was just trying my luck with Grandma as my last resort.

405
00:23:18,197 --> 00:23:19,227
I am going upstairs.

406
00:23:21,097 --> 00:23:24,497
Give it up. That is better for everyone.

407
00:23:24,567 --> 00:23:26,267
Good night, daughter.

408
00:23:36,607 --> 00:23:38,077
You must be exhausted.

409
00:23:40,147 --> 00:23:41,317
You are upset, right, honey?

410
00:23:42,787 --> 00:23:45,687
I have told you many times that I am immune to it.

411
00:23:45,757 --> 00:23:47,087
I am sorry. I should have stepped up...

412
00:23:47,157 --> 00:23:51,087
- and taken your side. - That is what I asked you to do.

413
00:23:52,457 --> 00:23:54,727
A son taking his wife's side...

414
00:23:54,797 --> 00:23:56,497
from the perspective of the mother who raised him...

415
00:23:56,567 --> 00:23:58,837
is unconditionally hurtful and ungrateful.

416
00:24:00,137 --> 00:24:01,837
Your thoughts are enough for me.

417
00:24:04,037 --> 00:24:05,037
Anyway.

418
00:24:06,337 --> 00:24:09,777
I am a bit tired. I should go to sleep now.

419
00:24:09,847 --> 00:24:13,717
Oh, okay. You go to sleep first. Okay, sleep.

420
00:24:16,517 --> 00:24:18,417
Okay.

421
00:24:18,487 --> 00:24:19,517
There you go.

422
00:24:34,367 --> 00:24:35,837
What?

423
00:24:35,907 --> 00:24:36,937
Did I come to the wrong house?

424
00:24:38,137 --> 00:24:39,177
This is my place.

425
00:24:41,547 --> 00:24:44,147
Could it be Mom?

426
00:24:52,057 --> 00:24:54,057
Where are you running off to, son?

427
00:24:56,257 --> 00:24:58,627
Mom, when did you get here?

428
00:24:58,697 --> 00:25:02,727
- Oh, I could have cleaned this up. - I just finished scrubbing...

429
00:25:02,797 --> 00:25:07,297
your moldy toilet bowl with this brush.

430
00:25:07,367 --> 00:25:08,907
Go sit down right now.

431
00:25:08,967 --> 00:25:11,167
Or else I am going to shove this stinking...

432
00:25:11,237 --> 00:25:12,807
toilet brush down your throat.

433
00:25:25,617 --> 00:25:28,957
Hey, sit on the floor.

434
00:25:29,027 --> 00:25:30,887
This sofa is not yours anymore.

435
00:25:37,627 --> 00:25:38,697
What happened?

436
00:25:40,897 --> 00:25:44,067
Oh, because the house is so dirty?

437
00:25:44,137 --> 00:25:48,107
You must be really mad. You know me, Mom.

438
00:25:48,177 --> 00:25:50,347
I used to be a neat freak.

439
00:25:50,407 --> 00:25:53,247
But work has been so stressful lately...

440
00:25:53,317 --> 00:25:55,187
that I think I am losing my mind.

441
00:25:55,247 --> 00:25:58,387
Mom, have you heard of a mental breakdown?

442
00:25:58,457 --> 00:26:00,587
Oh, I really had one.

443
00:26:00,657 --> 00:26:03,057
Are you kidding me right now?

444
00:26:03,127 --> 00:26:05,027
Do you think I am asking about the dirty house?

445
00:26:07,397 --> 00:26:10,997
- Then what? - Do you think your mom is an idiot?

446
00:26:11,067 --> 00:26:14,867
I was blessed with great eyesight. At my age, it is still 1.5 and 1.2.

447
00:26:16,407 --> 00:26:17,707
What are those red tags?

448
00:26:21,947 --> 00:26:25,977
How much debt are you in, and for how long,

449
00:26:26,047 --> 00:26:27,547
to have those stuck on your things in this day and age?

450
00:26:29,247 --> 00:26:32,687
Did you co-sign a loan for someone like your brother did?

451
00:26:34,417 --> 00:26:36,827
Mom, how could you compare me to him?

452
00:26:36,887 --> 00:26:38,857
- It is nothing like that. - Then what?

453
00:26:40,627 --> 00:26:41,697
Well, actually...

454
00:26:43,867 --> 00:26:46,337
I followed a senior at work and invested in something,

455
00:26:46,397 --> 00:26:48,367
but I took a bit of a loss.

456
00:26:48,437 --> 00:26:49,437
How much?

457
00:26:52,177 --> 00:26:54,437
You are a genius.

458
00:26:54,507 --> 00:26:57,377
Give me a number. Down to the last cent.

459
00:26:59,477 --> 00:27:00,577
You want me to tell you everything?

460
00:27:02,047 --> 00:27:03,847
Then you will try to kill me.

461
00:27:03,917 --> 00:27:05,617
We live in a world where mothers like that...

462
00:27:05,687 --> 00:27:08,217
end up on the news, but you know I am not one of them.

463
00:27:12,757 --> 00:27:14,027
Actually, it is...

464
00:27:16,027 --> 00:27:17,997
The total amount is...

465
00:27:31,777 --> 00:27:35,416
What are you doing, Mom?

466
00:27:35,417 --> 00:27:37,387
You said you would not kill me.

467
00:27:38,787 --> 00:27:42,787
Come here, you. How could even you do this to me?

468
00:27:42,857 --> 00:27:45,727
How could all my kids do this to me?

469
00:27:48,467 --> 00:27:51,297
(Mission: Mompossible)

470
00:28:09,647 --> 00:28:13,287
Have I ever caused you trouble with anything else before?

471
00:28:13,987 --> 00:28:16,587
Da Mi is not even your biological child.

472
00:28:16,657 --> 00:28:18,797
I am really going to sew that mouth of yours shut...

473
00:28:18,857 --> 00:28:21,057
one of these days.

474
00:28:21,127 --> 00:28:23,797
Hello, sir. We meet again.

475
00:28:23,867 --> 00:28:25,397
Could I get your phone number?

476
00:28:31,977 --> 00:28:33,877
(Mission: Mompossible)
